Download instructions for Adalogger FeatherWing files:

1. Visit GitHub: https://github.com/adafruit/Adafruit-Feather-RTC-SD-Data-Logger-FeatherWing-PCB
2. Download the .brd file (EAGLE format)

Note: To convert .brd to STEP:
- Import into Autodesk Fusion 360
- Export as STEP file
- Or use FreeCAD with KiCad StepUp plugin

Once downloaded/converted, place the file here and commit.
